{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12331","headline":"省试湘灵鼓瑟 · 钱起","name":"省试湘灵鼓瑟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"善鼓云和瑟，常闻帝子灵。\n冯夷空自舞，楚客不堪听。\n苦调凄金石，清音入杳冥。\n苍梧来怨慕，白芷动芳馨。\n流水传潇浦，悲风过洞庭。\n曲终人不见，江上数峰青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12331.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12331","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"黄全彦"}